00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.100
this may be like you
know all about this.

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.600
But let's say there
are some people

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.310
in the audience who
perhaps are just

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:55.870
starting with machine learning.

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:58.870
The key thing is machine
learning is nothing but--

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:02.140
think about it as human
decision making on a chip.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:04.120
The difference is a
chip does not get tired

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:08.110
and you can execute
multiple variable scenarios

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:12.550
at the way human beings
do at scale on a chip.

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:17.482
So what that enables
is we can now

00:12:17.482 --> 00:12:18.940
consider the fact
that, when you're

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:22.630
