00:28:38.680 --> 00:28:40.590
as an example.

00:28:40.590 --> 00:28:42.590
Now, going back to--

00:28:42.590 --> 00:28:47.290
with that, I would like to go
back to the main presentation.

00:28:47.290 --> 00:28:50.540
And I talked about the fact that
