00:29:25.020 --> 00:29:27.230
So this is the architecture.

00:29:27.230 --> 00:29:33.260
Again, for more
detailed discussion

00:29:33.260 --> 00:29:35.810
on this architecture, we
can have the discussion

00:29:35.810 --> 00:29:38.150
after the main presentation.

00:29:38.150 --> 00:29:43.260
What it is just showing
